---
import ProjectLayout from "../layouts/project-layout.astro"
import Button1 from "../components/button1.astro"
import Image from "../components/image.astro"

import playerImg from "../assets/projects/page-images/botanicPlayer.png"
---

<ProjectLayout name="botanic" colour="#185188">
    <div class="paragraph">
        <p>
            Botanic was a combined capstone and district authority award project. 
            I spent around a combined 130 hours creating this website and songs from scratch. 
            The audio player was built in JavaScript using the audioCTX API. 
            The background and icons were animated using the anime.js where I created shapes 
            in Adobe Illustrator and animated the SVG paths in JavaScript. 
        </p>
        
    </div>
    <Image src={playerImg.src} colour="#245460" class="playerImg"></Image>

    <div class="paragraph">
        <p>
            The songs were all composed and arranged by me in Ableton Live Lite 11 as a 
            journey of inspiration for creating art. This project let me discover the ways 
            I like to create art and helped my diagnose where I find the biggest obstacles 
            while allowing me to combine the two areas of creation I find the most enjoyable. 
            Music and Computer Science.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="btn">
        <Button1 href="https://andrewkehler.github.io/Botanic">See Project</Button1>
    </div>
</ProjectLayout>
<style>
	@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Graduate&family=Intel+One+Mono:ital,wght@0,300..700;1,300..700&display=swap');

	.graduate-regular {
		font-family: "Graduate", serif;
		font-weight: 400;
		font-style: normal;
	}
	body{
		margin: 0;
		overflow-x: hidden;
		
	}

</style>
<style>
    .btn{
        display: flex;
        align-self: center;
        justify-self: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 100%;
        font-size: clamp(.5em, 0.8vw, 2em);
    }

    .playerImg{
        position: relative;
        width: 25%;
        justify-self: flex-end;
        margin: -5% -5% 0 0;
        transform: scaleX(-1);
    }
    .playerImg :global(img){
        transform: scaleX(-1);
        margin-top: 5%;
        padding-top: 8%;
    }
</style>